{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "settings.home.chiefPetEnabled.help" : {
      "comment" : "Settings > Home: help under the Show Chief Pet toggle. Chief is a product name; a session is an agent or terminal session. ⌃⌥⌘C is the default key of Message the Chief from Any App; keep the symbols as they are.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A small Chief over every app shows agent events. ⌃⌥⌘C opens its reply box."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Chief صغير فوق كل التطبيقات يعرض أحداث الوكلاء. يفتح ⌃⌥⌘C مربع الرد الخاص به."
          }
        },
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mali Chief iznad svih aplikacija prikazuje događaje agenata. ⌃⌥⌘C otvara njegovo polje za odgovor."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En lille Chief over alle apps viser agenthændelser. ⌃⌥⌘C åbner dens svarfelt."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ein kleiner Chief über allen Apps zeigt Agent-Ereignisse. ⌃⌥⌘C öffnet sein Antwortfeld."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un pequeño Chief sobre todas las apps muestra los eventos de los agentes. ⌃⌥⌘C abre su cuadro de respuesta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un petit Chief au-dessus de toutes les apps affiche les événements des agents. ⌃⌥⌘C ouvre sa zone de réponse."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un piccolo Chief sopra tutte le app mostra gli eventi degli agenti. ⌃⌥⌘C apre la sua casella di risposta."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "すべてのアプリの上に小さな Chief が浮かび、エージェントのイベントを表示します。⌃⌥⌘C で返信ボックスを開きます。"
          }
        },
        "km" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Chief តូចមួយលើកម្មវិធីទាំងអស់បង្ហាញព្រឹត្តិការណ៍ភ្នាក់ងារ។ ⌃⌥⌘C បើកប្រអប់ឆ្លើយតបរបស់វា។"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "작은 Chief가 모든 앱 위에서 에이전트 이벤트를 보여 줍니다. ⌃⌥⌘C로 답장 상자를 엽니다."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En liten Chief over alle apper viser agenthendelser. ⌃⌥⌘C åpner svarfeltet."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mały Chief nad wszystkimi aplikacjami pokazuje zdarzenia agentów. ⌃⌥⌘C otwiera jego pole odpowiedzi."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Um pequeno Chief sobre todos os apps mostra eventos dos agentes. ⌃⌥⌘C abre a caixa de resposta."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Маленький Chief поверх всех приложений показывает события агентов. ⌃⌥⌘C открывает его поле ответа."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Chief ตัวเล็กเหนือทุกแอปแสดงเหตุการณ์ของเอเจนต์ ⌃⌥⌘C เปิดช่องตอบกลับ"
